+# --- Email (Resend) --------------------------------------------------------
+# Used for password-reset codes (routes/password.routes.ts) and critical-error
+# alert emails (lib/alerts.ts). Leave RESEND_API_KEY blank to disable both -
+# password reset then fails closed with a clear message instead of silently
