+ALERT_EMAIL=
+
+# --- Supabase (used for user-uploaded delivery/attachment files) -----------
+SUPABASE_URL=
+SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
+SUPABASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=user-deliveries
+
+# --- PII retention ----------------------------------------------------------
+# How many days of encrypted NIN/BVN/slip-PDF data (metadata.pii on a
+# Transaction) to keep before scripts/purge-expired-pii.ts blanks it out.
+# Runs automatically once a day from server.ts, and can also be triggered
+# manually with `npm run purge:pii`.
